OL,3,GNEWSAOriginal trophies tracked down for
OL,4,Ashow's return
OL,5,
OL,6,FA year-long search for the original
OL,7,Ftrophies from a community show has paid
OL,8,Foff, just weeks before its return.
OL,10,FThe Durham City Show is being brought
OL,11,Fback after a 15-year hiatus, heralding
OL,12,Fthe return of the longest carrot award
OL,13,Fand plaudits for the "rudest vegetable
OL,14,For vegetable disaster" among a string
OL,15,Fof categories hailing fruits, flowers,
OL,16,Fcrafters and bakers.
OL,18,FOrganisers had been scouring old
OL,19,Fnewspaper reports and show programmes
OL,20,Ffor the trophies, eventually tracing
OL,21,Fthem to Belmont charity Cheesy Waffles.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
