OL,3,GNEWSAOriginal trophies tracked down for
OL,4,Ashow's return
OL,5,
OL,6,F"They are part of the show's heritage,
OL,7,Fand it's great they can again be part
OL,8,Fof our celebration of the talents
OL,9,Fwithin our community," said show
OL,10,Fcommittee chair Benedict Douglas.
